  m_Name: ConsoleFrog
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MinigameDefinition
  <Id>k__BackingField: console_frog
  <SceneBuildIndex>k__BackingField: 14
  <GameType>k__BackingField: 2
  <GameDuration>k__BackingField: 75
  <IsTimeLimited>k__BackingField: 1
  <StartDelay>k__BackingField: 3
  <DisplayName>k__BackingField: 'Console: Frog Hop'
  <Description>k__BackingField: Hop across the busy road and ride the logs over the
    river to the lily pads. Every crossing makes the traffic faster.
  <PreviewImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 96f99809a74dbfd4f99feed36e2c0224, type: 3}
  <Rules>k__BackingField:
  - Each hop further than before scores, the far bank scores 5
  - On the river you must ride a log
  - Crash and you restart - only your best run counts
  <Objective>k__BackingField: Hop the furthest.
  <Danger>k__BackingField: Cars squash you; the water and the screen edge end the
    run.
  <Scoring>k__BackingField: Points in your best run; everyone gets the same lanes.
  <Controls>k__BackingField:
  - W A S D|Hop
  - SPACE|Hop forward
